					<h1>Broker-Dealers</h1>
					
					<P>Through the combination of leading-edge technology and a team of experienced professionals, we focus on understanding the unique needs of our broker-dealer clients to ensure you receive maximum support and the investment solutions you need to meet your trading and infrastructure needs. BNY ConvergEx Group offers solutions that enable broker-dealers to enhance their efficiency and effectiveness in meeting the rapidly changing requirements of the execution business marketplace.</P>
